      "lineNbr": 71,
      "author": {
        "id": 1881060
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-18T23:04:23Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This reflects the source of audio for the audio input of the remote device.\n\nExample on a hearing aid device.  \nThe audio can come from multiples sources:\n* From the phone, when streaming music → AudioInputType.Bluetooth\n* From surrounding sound, to help against hearing loss → AudioInputType.Ambient\n* From telecoil, when receiving the sound from the TV at home → AudioInputType.Streaming\n* From Auracast, when receiving broadcast news in airport / gare → AudioInputType.Streaming\n\nEven if the device is techincally a  **BluetoothDevice** in all the situtation, its source of audio may have multiple origins.",
      "parentUuid": "c9c8311c_7aa1191a",
      "revId": "c9439e9f79672fd4b07803accaba5f5d21290398",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
