      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e When the value of the Gain_Mode field is either Automatic Only or Manual Only, the server does not support changes to the Gain_Mode field. When the value of the Gain_Mode field is either Automatic or Manual, the server supports switching between the Automatic and Manual values of the Gain_Mode field.\n\nAs stated by `2.2.1.3. Gain_Mode field`  \n\nI edited the different mode to indicate that.",
